shape: sequence_diagram

source: Synthetic EventSource
engine: MatchProcessor
api: FastAPI / SSE
ui: React broadcast UI
orchestrator: Agent orchestrator
foundry: Foundry agents
verifier: Deterministic claim verifier

source -> engine: validated canonical MatchEvent
engine -> api: accepted event
api -> ui: SSE match_event
engine -> api: tactical insight + evidence IDs
api -> ui: SSE tactical_insight
ui -> api: GET evidence for selected insight
api -> ui: exact source events + deterministic metrics

engine -> orchestrator: high-value insight candidate (planned)
orchestrator -> foundry: read-only evidence + audience profile (planned)
foundry -> verifier: structured narrative + references (planned)
verifier -> orchestrator: accepted / rejected claim (planned)
orchestrator -> api: verified narrative for same insight ID (planned)
api -> ui: asynchronous personalized narrative (planned)
